From bea79e4adf61031d98e05d680414efff86267992 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kob <kob@invalid>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:19:34 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] Lift A+G: foreground demand, spare-capacity warming,
 strict warming reads, waiting playback in load (fork 95a9d85a e05d42c6
 f7120c54 d853830e 7641c95a)

Prerequisites taken minimally: Workload::Warm, SegmentReader background /
with_warming and Warm fault reports (fork 8284cbb7); warm_lane (fork
b2724e71); preference(workload) / busy_permille(warming) (fork #268,
b2d799bf) without its pending-connect and warm_waiting logic. Wire credits,
Metered refill fix and retained-cache warming are not lifted. Fork tests use
LoopbackServer::hold_article instead of start_gated(_many).
